## Appendix B: API Documentation

### Authentication Endpoints

**Register User**
```
POST /api/register
Body: {
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "phone": "+1234567890",
  "password": "securepass123"
}
Response: {
  "message": "User registered successfully",
  "user_id": "uuid"
}
```

**User Login**
```
POST /api/login
Body: {
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "securepass123"
}
Response: {
  "token": "jwt-token-string",
  "user": {
    "id": "uuid",
    "name": "John Doe",
    "email": "john@example.com"
  }
}
```

**Admin Login**
```
POST /api/admin/login
Body: {
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}
Response: {
  "token": "admin-jwt-token",
  "admin": {
    "id": "uuid",
    "username": "admin"
  }
}
```

### Car Endpoints

**Get All Cars**
```
GET /api/cars
Response: [
  {
    "_id": "uuid",
    "name": "Tesla Model 3",
    "model": "2024",
    "category": "Electric",
    "price_per_day": 150,
    ...
  }
]
```

**Get Single Car**
```
GET /api/cars/{car_id}
Response: {
  "_id": "uuid",
  "name": "Tesla Model 3",
  ...
}
```

### Booking Endpoints

**Create Booking** (Requires Authentication)
```
POST /api/bookings
Headers: {
  "Authorization": "Bearer jwt-token"
}
Body: {
  "car_id": "uuid",
  "start_date": "2024-11-25",
  "end_date": "2024-11-27",
  "license_card": "DL1234567890",
  "id_card": "ID9876543210"
}
Response: {
  "message": "Booking created successfully",
  "booking_id": "uuid",
  "total_price": 450
}
```

**Get User Bookings** (Requires Authentication)
```
GET /api/bookings/user
Headers: {
  "Authorization": "Bearer jwt-token"
}
Response: [
  {
    "_id": "uuid",
    "car_name": "Tesla Model 3",
    "start_date": "2024-11-25",
    "total_price": 450,
    ...
  }
]
```

### Admin Endpoints

**Get All Bookings** (Requires Admin Auth)
```
GET /api/admin/bookings
Headers: {
  "Authorization": "Bearer admin-jwt-token"
}
Response: [
  {
    "_id": "uuid",
    "user_name": "John Doe",
    "car_name": "Tesla Model 3",
    "license_card": "DL1234567890",
    ...
  }
]
```

**Get Statistics** (Requires Admin Auth)
```
GET /api/admin/statistics
Headers: {
  "Authorization": "Bearer admin-jwt-token"
}
Response: {
  "total_users": 15,
  "total_cars": 7,
  "total_bookings": 42,
  "available_cars": 5,
  "total_revenue": 8750,
  "recent_bookings": [...]
}
```

